# Semantic oracle evidence for the campaign's major objective mission types.
#
# Titania route trace SHA-256:
# 15c2cf7d12a8a59543df75bec06e0d444f07e5c1b549628426e6c8853bba62cc
# Titania base-entry trace SHA-256:
# c04ce38d91570389f06acb9bb1b2e2cdab690fe452fba82454a36b5a9bec1c4b
# Titania interior trace SHA-256:
# b54e4374ff02d71e0ebc67ab1274c605cccd2a1f5e48becee802d117e43c4379
# Titania final-switch/return trace SHA-256:
# f5825d512632f63adcad56d1c11e0b72321e3b962d8ecb3dd31e47f878737f94
# Eladard route trace SHA-256:
# dae037a9105689d8eabd4d50f13c2c28962a49a1d7644ddcf3f65c644c612be5
# Expert Battle Carrier reuse trace SHA-256:
# 7f753514577ffff1ca59fb9092df3525b62a45e05299d59cef8eec9b8bd2a4bc
#
# The carrier trace is a natural completion of the shared selection-8 mission
# after a campaign reset. It proves the mission identity and full return path.
# The retail difficulty tables independently scope the paired deployment to
# Expert; Normal and Hard each deploy one Battle Carrier.
# The compact Eladard trace begins from a prepared campaign state. It proves
# selection-3 mission identity and a return boundary, but it does not certify
# natural surface, interior, generator-defeat, or mission-completion behavior.
target name=titania mission_selection=1 required_visits=1
target name=eladard mission_selection=3 required_visits=1
target name=battle_carrier difficulty=expert mission_selection=8 required_visits=2
objective target=titania name=surface_switch count=2
objective target=titania name=final_switch count=1
# Objective progression is player/contact driven. Only presentation transitions
# retain oracle-derived relative timing; there are no absolute mission timers.
transition target=titania name=second_switch_to_base_open retail_frames=56
transition target=titania name=final_switch_to_return retail_frames=926
transition target=titania name=return_to_map retail_frames=38
